    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Questoris Companions",
    "summary": "As your turn begins, if you have fulfilled your current Oath, set up an extra Oath as [Code Chivalric](vsdata:ability/imperial-knights.code-chivalric) describes, except:\n\n- you cannot pick any Deed or Quality picked before; if a random roll gives you one of those, pick one you have not picked instead\n- once you have picked every Deed and every Quality, you set up no more extra Oaths\n\nQualities of the Oaths you have fulfilled keep applying to every model of yours with [Code Chivalric](vsdata:ability/imperial-knights.code-chivalric). Completing the Deed of an extra Oath gives you 1CP instead, however you picked its Deed or Quality.",
